    {
     "type": "quiz",
     "question": "What does the 30-40% rule mean for a freelancer's client portfolio?",
     "options": [
      {
       "text": "Charge 30-40% more than your old W-2 salary",
       "correct": false
      },
      {
       "text": "Save 30-40% of every invoice for taxes",
       "correct": false
      },
      {
       "text": "No single client should exceed 30-40% of your annual revenue",
       "correct": true
      },
      {
       "text": "Work 30-40 billable hours per week",
       "correct": false
      }
     ],
     "explanation": "The 30-40% rule is portfolio diversification: if one client is more than 30-40% of your income, you have a job in disguise — losing that client means insolvency. Spread risk across anchor (recurring), growth (project), and exploration (small) clients.",
     "visual": {
      "type": "diagram",
      "svg": "<svg viewBox=\"0 0 1100 1100\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><rect width=\"1100\" height=\"1100\" fill=\"#1a1a2e\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"70\" font-size=\"36\" fill=\"#FFD700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"bold\">The 30-40% Rule</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"115\" font-size=\"24\" fill=\"#888\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Portfolio Diversification, Freelancer Edition</text><rect x=\"80\" y=\"170\" width=\"940\" height=\"200\" fill=\"#1a1a2e\" stroke=\"#FFD700\" stroke-width=\"3\" rx=\"10\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"220\" font-size=\"26\" fill=\"#FFD700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"bold\">Single-Point-of-Failure Test</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"265\" font-size=\"22\" fill=\"#ffffff\" text-anchor=\"middle\">If you lost your biggest client tomorrow, would you go insolvent?</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"305\" font-size=\"22\" fill=\"#ffffff\" text-anchor=\"middle\">If YES → you have a job disguised as freelancing.</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"345\" font-size=\"22\" fill=\"#ffffff\" text-anchor=\"middle\">If NO → you have a diversified business.</text><rect x=\"80\" y=\"390\" width=\"940\" height=\"200\" fill=\"#1a1a2e\" stroke=\"#ef4444\" stroke-width=\"2\" rx=\"10\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"435\" font-size=\"26\" fill=\"#ef4444\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"bold\">Concentration Risk Examples</text><text x=\"120\" y=\"485\" font-size=\"22\" fill=\"#ffffff\">Client A: 65% of revenue → ONE client decides your survival</text><text x=\"120\" y=\"525\" font-size=\"22\" fill=\"#ffffff\">Client A: 45% → Still risky; start replacing immediately</text><text x=\"120\" y=\"565\" font-size=\"22\" fill=\"#ffffff\">Client A: 30% → Acceptable; monitor quarterly</text><rect x=\"80\" y=\"610\" width=\"940\" height=\"440\" fill=\"#1a1a2e\" stroke=\"#0ea5e9\" stroke-width=\"2\" rx=\"10\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"655\" font-size=\"26\" fill=\"#0ea5e9\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"bold\">Why It Matters Beyond Money</text><text x=\"120\" y=\"705\" font-size=\"22\" fill=\"#ffffff\">Negotiating leverage: you can walk; they can't</text><text x=\"120\" y=\"745\" font-size=\"22\" fill=\"#ffffff\">Scope discipline: 'we discussed that off-spec' — backed by other revenue</text><text x=\"120\" y=\"785\" font-size=\"22\" fill=\"#ffffff\">Rate increases: easier to ask when you're not desperate</text><text x=\"120\" y=\"825\" font-size=\"22\" fill=\"#ffffff\">Client firing: you can drop bad clients without panic</text><text x=\"120\" y=\"865\" font-size=\"22\" fill=\"#ffffff\">Mental health: 'this one bad email won't ruin my year'</text><text x=\"120\" y=\"905\" font-size=\"22\" fill=\"#ffffff\">Tax planning: smoother income = better quarterly estimates</text><text x=\"120\" y=\"945\" font-size=\"22\" fill=\"#ffffff\">Pricing power: 8 clients lets you raise rates with 4 of them</text><text x=\"120\" y=\"990\" font-size=\"22\" fill=\"#ffffff\">Skill development: variety = better professional growth</text><text x=\"120\" y=\"1030\" font-size=\"22\" fill=\"#ffffff\">Resilience: one client implosion is a Tuesday, not a crisis</text></svg>",
      "caption": "Diversification = the freelancer's real security blanket."
     }
    },
    {
     "type": "quote",
     "title": "From Horowitz",
     "content": "'The Freelancers Union exists to prove that we can build a new mutualism — that we, as independent workers, are not isolated atoms but a community capable of building our own safety net, our own institutions, and our own future. The W-2 job was an invention of the 20th century. Independent work has always existed — and it always will. The question is whether we organize it well, or let it organize us badly.' — Sara Horowitz, The Freelancer's Bible, 2012",
     "visual": {
      "type": "diagram",
      "svg": "<svg viewBox=\"0 0 1100 1100\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><rect width=\"1100\" height=\"1100\" fill=\"#1a1a2e\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"70\" font-size=\"36\" fill=\"#FFD700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"bold\">Closing Thought</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"115\" font-size=\"24\" fill=\"#888\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Horowitz, in Her Own Words</text><rect x=\"80\" y=\"170\" width=\"940\" height=\"600\" fill=\"#1a1a2e\" stroke=\"#FFD700\" stroke-width=\"3\" rx=\"10\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"230\" font-size=\"26\" fill=\"#FFD700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"bold\">From the Introduction</text><text x=\"130\" y=\"290\" font-size=\"22\" fill=\"#ffffff\">'The Freelancers Union exists to prove that we</text><text x=\"130\" y=\"330\" font-size=\"22\" fill=\"#ffffff\">can build a new mutualism — that we, as</text><text x=\"130\" y=\"370\" font-size=\"22\" fill=\"#ffffff\">independent workers, are not isolated atoms but</text><text x=\"130\" y=\"410\" font-size=\"22\" fill=\"#ffffff\">a community capable of building our own safety</text><text x=\"130\" y=\"450\" font-size=\"22\" fill=\"#ffffff\">net, our own institutions, and our own future.</text><text x=\"130\" y=\"510\" font-size=\"22\" fill=\"#ffffff\">The W-2 job was an invention of the 20th</text><text x=\"130\" y=\"550\" font-size=\"22\" fill=\"#ffffff\">century. Independent work has always existed —</text><text x=\"130\" y=\"590\" font-size=\"22\" fill=\"#ffffff\">and it always will. The question is whether we</text><text x=\"130\" y=\"630\" font-size=\"22\" fill=\"#ffffff\">organize it well, or let it organize us badly.'</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"710\" font-size=\"22\" fill=\"#FFD700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-style=\"italic\">— Sara Horowitz, The Freelancer's Bible, 2012</text><rect x=\"80\" y=\"790\" width=\"940\" height=\"260\" fill=\"#1a1a2e\" stroke=\"#FFD700\" stroke-width=\"2\" rx=\"10\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"835\" font-size=\"26\" fill=\"#0ea5e9\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"bold\">Next Lesson</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"885\" font-size=\"22\" fill=\"#ffffff\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Setting Up Shop: business structures (LLC, S-corp),</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"925\" font-size=\"22\" fill=\"#ffffff\" text-anchor=\"middle\">EIN, business bank account, and insurance.</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"985\" font-size=\"22\" fill=\"#ffffff\" text-anchor=\"middle\">The legal scaffolding that turns 'doing some</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"1025\" font-size=\"22\" fill=\"#ffffff\" text-anchor=\"middle\">freelance work' into a real business entity.</text></svg>",
      "caption": "Mindset is the foundation. Operations is the building. Onward."
     }
    }
