    {
     "type": "quiz",
     "question": "Maya is choosing between a Bronze ($300/mo, $7K deductible) and Silver ($500/mo, $3K deductible) ACA plan. Her income qualifies for cost-sharing reductions. Which is typically the better choice?",
     "options": [
      {
       "text": "Bronze — always pick the lowest premium",
       "correct": false
      },
      {
       "text": "Silver — CSR subsidies are only available on Silver, making it equivalent to Gold for low premium",
       "correct": true
      },
      {
       "text": "Neither — go uninsured to save money",
       "correct": false
      },
      {
       "text": "Bronze — deductibles don't matter for healthy people",
       "correct": false
      }
     ],
     "explanation": "Cost-Sharing Reduction (CSR) subsidies are ONLY available on SILVER plans. If income is below 250% of poverty line, CSR can make Silver function like Gold or Platinum (90%+ covered) while keeping the Silver premium. Choosing Bronze 'because it's cheaper' loses thousands in CSR value. Always run the math on healthcare.gov — the subsidy hides this.",
     "visual": {
      "type": "diagram",
      "svg": "<svg viewBox=\"0 0 1100 1100\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><rect width=\"1100\" height=\"1100\" fill=\"#1a1a2e\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"70\" font-size=\"36\" fill=\"#FFD700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"bold\">CSR: Silver Wins</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"115\" font-size=\"24\" fill=\"#888\" text-anchor=\"middle\">The Hidden Subsidy Most Freelancers Miss</text><rect x=\"80\" y=\"170\" width=\"940\" height=\"200\" fill=\"#1a1a2e\" stroke=\"#FFD700\" stroke-width=\"3\" rx=\"10\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"215\" font-size=\"26\" fill=\"#FFD700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"bold\">CSR Eligibility</text><text x=\"120\" y=\"265\" font-size=\"22\" fill=\"#ffffff\">Income below 250% federal poverty line</text><text x=\"120\" y=\"305\" font-size=\"22\" fill=\"#ffffff\">~$36K single, ~$75K family of 4 (2024)</text><text x=\"120\" y=\"345\" font-size=\"22\" fill=\"#ffffff\">Available ONLY on SILVER tier plans</text><rect x=\"80\" y=\"390\" width=\"940\" height=\"240\" fill=\"#1a1a2e\" stroke=\"#0ea5e9\" stroke-width=\"2\" rx=\"10\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"435\" font-size=\"26\" fill=\"#0ea5e9\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"bold\">What CSR Does to Silver</text><text x=\"120\" y=\"485\" font-size=\"22\" fill=\"#ffffff\">Standard Silver: 70% covered, $3K deductible</text><text x=\"120\" y=\"525\" font-size=\"22\" fill=\"#ffffff\">With CSR at 200% FPL: 73% covered, $2K deductible</text><text x=\"120\" y=\"565\" font-size=\"22\" fill=\"#ffffff\">With CSR at 150% FPL: 87% covered, $750 deductible</text><text x=\"120\" y=\"605\" font-size=\"22\" fill=\"#ffffff\">With CSR at 100% FPL: 94% covered, $250 deductible</text><rect x=\"80\" y=\"650\" width=\"940\" height=\"220\" fill=\"#1a1a2e\" stroke=\"#ef4444\" stroke-width=\"2\" rx=\"10\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"695\" font-size=\"26\" fill=\"#ef4444\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"bold\">Why Bronze Loses for CSR-Eligible</text><text x=\"120\" y=\"745\" font-size=\"22\" fill=\"#ffffff\">Bronze: 60% covered, $7K deductible — no CSR available</text><text x=\"120\" y=\"785\" font-size=\"22\" fill=\"#ffffff\">$200/mo savings vs Silver = $2,400/year</text><text x=\"120\" y=\"825\" font-size=\"22\" fill=\"#ffffff\">But $4K higher deductible = lose $1,600 first hospital visit</text><rect x=\"80\" y=\"890\" width=\"940\" height=\"160\" fill=\"#1a1a2e\" stroke=\"#FFD700\" stroke-width=\"3\" rx=\"10\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"935\" font-size=\"26\" fill=\"#FFD700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"bold\">Action</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"980\" font-size=\"22\" fill=\"#ffffff\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Run BOTH Bronze AND Silver in healthcare.gov comparison.</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"1020\" font-size=\"22\" fill=\"#ffffff\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Compare premium + expected out-of-pocket cost.</text></svg>",
      "caption": "CSR is the hidden tier-tipper. Always compare both Bronze and Silver."
     }
    },
    {
     "type": "concept",
     "title": "Estate Planning: The Hour That Saves Your Family",
     "content": "Even single freelancers in their 20s need three documents: (1) WILL — directs assets if you die. (2) DURABLE POWER OF ATTORNEY — lets a chosen person handle finances if you're incapacitated. (3) HEALTHCARE PROXY + ADVANCE DIRECTIVE — medical decisions if you can't communicate. Without these, courts decide everything — your business assets freeze, hospitals default to maximum intervention, your family fights. Cost: $100-500 for online services (FreeWill, Trust & Will), $1,500-3,000 for attorney. Time: 1-3 hours.",
     "visual": {
      "type": "diagram",
      "svg": "<svg viewBox=\"0 0 1100 1100\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><rect width=\"1100\" height=\"1100\" fill=\"#1a1a2e\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"70\" font-size=\"36\" fill=\"#FFD700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"bold\">Estate Planning Basics</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"115\" font-size=\"24\" fill=\"#888\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Three Documents Everyone Over 18 Needs</text><rect x=\"80\" y=\"170\" width=\"940\" height=\"200\" fill=\"#1a1a2e\" stroke=\"#0ea5e9\" stroke-width=\"2\" rx=\"10\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"215\" font-size=\"26\" fill=\"#0ea5e9\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"bold\">1. Will</text><text x=\"120\" y=\"265\" font-size=\"22\" fill=\"#ffffff\">Directs business + personal assets if you die</text><text x=\"120\" y=\"305\" font-size=\"22\" fill=\"#ffffff\">Names executor (person who handles distribution)</text><text x=\"120\" y=\"345\" font-size=\"22\" fill=\"#ffffff\">Specifies guardian for minor children</text><rect x=\"80\" y=\"390\" width=\"940\" height=\"200\" fill=\"#1a1a2e\" stroke=\"#FFD700\" stroke-width=\"2\" rx=\"10\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"435\" font-size=\"26\" fill=\"#FFD700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"bold\">2. Durable Power of Attorney</text><text x=\"120\" y=\"485\" font-size=\"22\" fill=\"#ffffff\">Designates someone to handle finances if incapacitated</text><text x=\"120\" y=\"525\" font-size=\"22\" fill=\"#ffffff\">Pay your bills, manage business, file taxes</text><text x=\"120\" y=\"565\" font-size=\"22\" fill=\"#ffffff\">Without it: courts appoint a conservator (slow, costly)</text><rect x=\"80\" y=\"610\" width=\"940\" height=\"200\" fill=\"#1a1a2e\" stroke=\"#ef4444\" stroke-width=\"2\" rx=\"10\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"655\" font-size=\"26\" fill=\"#ef4444\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"bold\">3. Healthcare Proxy + Advance Directive</text><text x=\"120\" y=\"705\" font-size=\"22\" fill=\"#ffffff\">Names medical decision-maker</text><text x=\"120\" y=\"745\" font-size=\"22\" fill=\"#ffffff\">Documents wishes (life support, organ donation)</text><text x=\"120\" y=\"785\" font-size=\"22\" fill=\"#ffffff\">Without: hospital defaults to maximum intervention</text><rect x=\"80\" y=\"830\" width=\"450\" height=\"220\" fill=\"#1a1a2e\" stroke=\"#0ea5e9\" stroke-width=\"2\" rx=\"10\"/><text x=\"305\" y=\"875\" font-size=\"26\" fill=\"#0ea5e9\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"bold\">DIY Online</text><text x=\"110\" y=\"925\" font-size=\"22\" fill=\"#ffffff\">FreeWill.com (free)</text><text x=\"110\" y=\"965\" font-size=\"22\" fill=\"#ffffff\">Trust &amp; Will ($89)</text><text x=\"110\" y=\"1005\" font-size=\"22\" fill=\"#ffffff\">LegalZoom ($179)</text><text x=\"110\" y=\"1045\" font-size=\"18\" fill=\"#888\">Fine for simple estates</text><rect x=\"570\" y=\"830\" width=\"450\" height=\"220\" fill=\"#1a1a2e\" stroke=\"#FFD700\" stroke-width=\"2\" rx=\"10\"/><text x=\"795\" y=\"875\" font-size=\"26\" fill=\"#FFD700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"bold\">Estate Attorney</text><text x=\"600\" y=\"925\" font-size=\"22\" fill=\"#ffffff\">$1,500-3,000</text><text x=\"600\" y=\"965\" font-size=\"22\" fill=\"#ffffff\">For business owners</text><text x=\"600\" y=\"1005\" font-size=\"22\" fill=\"#ffffff\">Includes trusts if needed</text><text x=\"600\" y=\"1045\" font-size=\"18\" fill=\"#888\">Worth it above $500K assets</text></svg>",
      "caption": "1 hour. $100-500. Saves family from probate nightmare."
     }
    },
    {
     "type": "quiz",
     "question": "Which TWO insurance gaps cause the most financial damage to freelancers, according to FU member surveys?",
     "options": [
      {
       "text": "Pet insurance + dental insurance",
       "correct": false
      },
      {
       "text": "Long-term disability + emergency fund (functions as self-insurance)",
       "correct": true
      },
      {
       "text": "Life insurance + identity theft monitoring",
       "correct": false
      },
      {
       "text": "Travel insurance + rental car insurance",
       "correct": false
      }
     ],
     "explanation": "Long-term disability and emergency fund are the two highest-impact gaps. Disability is more statistically likely than death (4x at age 30) and replaces income for years. Emergency fund (6-9 months expenses) absorbs lumpy income, late payments, and unexpected slow quarters — and gives pricing power. Skipping either creates the most ruinous freelance failure modes.",
     "visual": {
      "type": "diagram",
      "svg": "<svg viewBox=\"0 0 1100 1100\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><rect width=\"1100\" height=\"1100\" fill=\"#1a1a2e\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"70\" font-size=\"36\" fill=\"#FFD700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"bold\">The Two Biggest Gaps</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"115\" font-size=\"24\" fill=\"#888\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Long-Term Disability + Emergency Fund</text><rect x=\"80\" y=\"170\" width=\"940\" height=\"280\" fill=\"#1a1a2e\" stroke=\"#ef4444\" stroke-width=\"2\" rx=\"10\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"215\" font-size=\"26\" fill=\"#ef4444\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"bold\">Gap 1: Disability Insurance</text><text x=\"120\" y=\"265\" font-size=\"22\" fill=\"#ffffff\">75% of freelancers have ZERO disability coverage (FU 2024)</text><text x=\"120\" y=\"305\" font-size=\"22\" fill=\"#ffffff\">4x more likely than death before 65</text><text x=\"120\" y=\"345\" font-size=\"22\" fill=\"#ffffff\">Average claim duration: 34 months</text><text x=\"120\" y=\"385\" font-size=\"22\" fill=\"#ffffff\">Average income loss without coverage: $185,000</text><text x=\"120\" y=\"425\" font-size=\"22\" fill=\"#ffffff\">Premium: $40-150/mo would have prevented it</text><rect x=\"80\" y=\"470\" width=\"940\" height=\"280\" fill=\"#1a1a2e\" stroke=\"#FFD700\" stroke-width=\"2\" rx=\"10\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"515\" font-size=\"26\" fill=\"#FFD700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"bold\">Gap 2: Emergency Fund</text><text x=\"120\" y=\"565\" font-size=\"22\" fill=\"#ffffff\">62% of freelancers have less than 1 month expenses saved</text><text x=\"120\" y=\"605\" font-size=\"22\" fill=\"#ffffff\">Average freelancer goes back to W-2 within 18 months</text><text x=\"120\" y=\"645\" font-size=\"22\" fill=\"#ffffff\">Top reason: 'one slow quarter and I had no buffer'</text><text x=\"120\" y=\"685\" font-size=\"22\" fill=\"#ffffff\">Pricing power lost: every project becomes desperation move</text><text x=\"120\" y=\"725\" font-size=\"22\" fill=\"#ffffff\">6-month fund prevents the spiral</text><rect x=\"80\" y=\"770\" width=\"940\" height=\"280\" fill=\"#1a1a2e\" stroke=\"#FFD700\" stroke-width=\"3\" rx=\"10\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"815\" font-size=\"26\" fill=\"#FFD700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"bold\">The Two Highest-ROI Insurance Actions</text><text x=\"120\" y=\"865\" font-size=\"22\" fill=\"#ffffff\">1. Buy long-term disability with 'own occupation' clause</text><text x=\"120\" y=\"905\" font-size=\"22\" fill=\"#ffffff\">2. Build 6-month emergency fund in high-yield savings</text><text x=\"120\" y=\"965\" font-size=\"22\" fill=\"#ffffff\">Combined cost: $100/mo + 12-18 months of disciplined saving</text><text x=\"120\" y=\"1005\" font-size=\"22\" fill=\"#ffffff\">Combined value: career resilience under any disruption</text><text x=\"120\" y=\"1045\" font-size=\"22\" fill=\"#FFD700\">Until you have both, you are one event from collapse.</text></svg>",
      "caption": "Disability + emergency fund. The freelancer's twin shields."
     }
    },
    {
     "type": "practice",
     "title": "Practice: Get a Disability Insurance Quote This Week",
     "content": "EXERCISE (30 minutes): Get THREE long-term disability insurance quotes this week. Sources: (1) Guardian Life (top-rated, online quote tool), (2) Principal (professional association rates), (3) Policygenius.com (compares multiple). Specs to request: 'own occupation' definition, 60-70% income replacement, 90-day elimination period, benefits to age 65. Compare premiums. Pick the lowest from a top-rated carrier (AM Best A or A+). Bind a policy within 30 days. Average freelancer: $65-95/month. Skipping = highest-probability career failure cause.",
     "visual": {
      "type": "diagram",
      "svg": "<svg viewBox=\"0 0 1100 1100\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><rect width=\"1100\" height=\"1100\" fill=\"#1a1a2e\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"70\" font-size=\"36\" fill=\"#FFD700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"bold\">Practice: Disability Quote</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"115\" font-size=\"24\" fill=\"#888\" text-anchor=\"middle\">30 Minutes to 3 Quotes</text><rect x=\"80\" y=\"170\" width=\"940\" height=\"200\" fill=\"#1a1a2e\" stroke=\"#FFD700\" stroke-width=\"3\" rx=\"10\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"215\" font-size=\"26\" fill=\"#FFD700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"bold\">Three Quote Sources</text><text x=\"120\" y=\"265\" font-size=\"22\" fill=\"#ffffff\">1. Guardian Life (guardianlife.com — online quote tool)</text><text x=\"120\" y=\"305\" font-size=\"22\" fill=\"#ffffff\">2. Principal Financial (principal.com — assoc rates)</text><text x=\"120\" y=\"345\" font-size=\"22\" fill=\"#ffffff\">3. Policygenius.com — compares 10+ carriers in one form</text><rect x=\"80\" y=\"390\" width=\"940\" height=\"280\" fill=\"#1a1a2e\" stroke=\"#0ea5e9\" stroke-width=\"2\" rx=\"10\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"435\" font-size=\"26\" fill=\"#0ea5e9\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"bold\">Specs to Request</text><text x=\"120\" y=\"485\" font-size=\"22\" fill=\"#ffffff\">Definition: 'Own occupation' (NOT 'any occupation')</text><text x=\"120\" y=\"525\" font-size=\"22\" fill=\"#ffffff\">Income replacement: 60-70% of pre-disability income</text><text x=\"120\" y=\"565\" font-size=\"22\" fill=\"#ffffff\">Elimination period: 90 days (lower premium than 30)</text><text x=\"120\" y=\"605\" font-size=\"22\" fill=\"#ffffff\">Benefit period: to age 65</text><text x=\"120\" y=\"645\" font-size=\"22\" fill=\"#ffffff\">Optional: COLA rider (3% annual benefit increase)</text><rect x=\"80\" y=\"690\" width=\"940\" height=\"200\" fill=\"#1a1a2e\" stroke=\"#ef4444\" stroke-width=\"2\" rx=\"10\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"735\" font-size=\"26\" fill=\"#ef4444\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"bold\">Pick the Winner</text><text x=\"120\" y=\"785\" font-size=\"22\" fill=\"#ffffff\">Verify carrier AM Best rating A or A+ (financial stability)</text><text x=\"120\" y=\"825\" font-size=\"22\" fill=\"#ffffff\">Compare apples-to-apples (same coverage, period, riders)</text><text x=\"120\" y=\"865\" font-size=\"22\" fill=\"#ffffff\">Pick lowest premium of qualifying options</text><rect x=\"80\" y=\"910\" width=\"940\" height=\"140\" fill=\"#1a1a2e\" stroke=\"#FFD700\" stroke-width=\"3\" rx=\"10\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"955\" font-size=\"26\" fill=\"#FFD700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"bold\">Bind Within 30 Days</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"1000\" font-size=\"22\" fill=\"#ffffff\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Pre-existing conditions discovered later = exclusion</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"1035\" font-size=\"22\" fill=\"#ffffff\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Healthier = cheaper. Apply while you're healthy.</text></svg>",
      "caption": "30 minutes today saves a career later. Get the quotes."
     }
    },
    {
     "type": "practice",
     "title": "Practice: Open Your Emergency Fund Account",
     "content": "EXERCISE (20 minutes): Open a high-yield savings account dedicated to your emergency fund. Best options: Marcus by Goldman Sachs, Ally Bank, Wealthfront Cash Account, Synchrony — all 4-5% APY in 2026, FDIC insured, no fees. Name the account 'Emergency Fund — Do Not Touch.' Step 2: calculate your monthly expenses (rent, utilities, food, insurance, basic transport). Target: 6 months expenses. Step 3: set automatic transfer of 5-10% of every invoice to this account until the target is hit. Then redirect to retirement/investing.",
     "visual": {
      "type": "diagram",
      "svg": "<svg viewBox=\"0 0 1100 1100\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><rect width=\"1100\" height=\"1100\" fill=\"#1a1a2e\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"70\" font-size=\"36\" fill=\"#FFD700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"bold\">Practice: Emergency Fund</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"115\" font-size=\"24\" fill=\"#888\" text-anchor=\"middle\">20 Minutes Setup; Months of Funding</text><rect x=\"80\" y=\"170\" width=\"940\" height=\"200\" fill=\"#1a1a2e\" stroke=\"#FFD700\" stroke-width=\"3\" rx=\"10\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"215\" font-size=\"26\" fill=\"#FFD700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"bold\">Best High-Yield Savings (2026)</text><text x=\"120\" y=\"265\" font-size=\"22\" fill=\"#ffffff\">Marcus by Goldman: 4.4% APY, no fees</text><text x=\"120\" y=\"305\" font-size=\"22\" fill=\"#ffffff\">Ally Bank: 4.25% APY, fastest transfers</text><text x=\"120\" y=\"345\" font-size=\"22\" fill=\"#ffffff\">Wealthfront Cash: 5.0% APY, $8M FDIC coverage</text><rect x=\"80\" y=\"390\" width=\"940\" height=\"200\" fill=\"#1a1a2e\" stroke=\"#0ea5e9\" stroke-width=\"2\" rx=\"10\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"435\" font-size=\"26\" fill=\"#0ea5e9\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"bold\">Calculate Your Target</text><text x=\"120\" y=\"485\" font-size=\"22\" fill=\"#ffffff\">Monthly essential expenses: $______</text><text x=\"120\" y=\"525\" font-size=\"22\" fill=\"#ffffff\">Rent + utilities + food + insurance + basic transport</text><text x=\"120\" y=\"565\" font-size=\"22\" fill=\"#ffffff\">6-month target: monthly x 6 = $______</text><rect x=\"80\" y=\"610\" width=\"940\" height=\"200\" fill=\"#1a1a2e\" stroke=\"#FFD700\" stroke-width=\"2\" rx=\"10\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"655\" font-size=\"26\" fill=\"#FFD700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"bold\">Funding Strategy</text><text x=\"120\" y=\"705\" font-size=\"22\" fill=\"#ffffff\">Phase 1 (12 months): 10% of every invoice → emergency fund</text><text x=\"120\" y=\"745\" font-size=\"22\" fill=\"#ffffff\">Phase 2 (target hit): redirect 10% to SEP-IRA</text><text x=\"120\" y=\"785\" font-size=\"22\" fill=\"#ffffff\">Quarterly: check balance, top up to target</text><rect x=\"80\" y=\"830\" width=\"940\" height=\"220\" fill=\"#1a1a2e\" stroke=\"#ef4444\" stroke-width=\"2\" rx=\"10\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"875\" font-size=\"26\" fill=\"#ef4444\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"bold\">The Rules</text><text x=\"120\" y=\"925\" font-size=\"22\" fill=\"#ffffff\">'Emergency' = lost client + no replacement, medical emergency,</text><text x=\"120\" y=\"965\" font-size=\"22\" fill=\"#ffffff\">major equipment failure, urgent family need</text><text x=\"120\" y=\"1005\" font-size=\"22\" fill=\"#ffffff\">NOT: equipment upgrades, conferences, vacations, slow month</text><text x=\"120\" y=\"1045\" font-size=\"22\" fill=\"#FFD700\">Touched it? Refill immediately at top of next month.</text></svg>",
      "caption": "Open today. Auto-fund. The fund is your real pricing leverage."
     }
    },
    {
     "type": "quote",
     "title": "From Horowitz",
     "content": "'Insurance is the most boring part of freelancing — and the most important. The self-employed who succeed are not the ones who never face crisis. They're the ones who built protection systems before crisis arrived. Health, disability, liability, emergency reserves — these are not luxuries. They are the prerequisites of a sustainable career. The day you stop being able to work for a client, your insurance becomes your client.' — Sara Horowitz, The Freelancer's Bible",
     "visual": {
      "type": "diagram",
      "svg": "<svg viewBox=\"0 0 1100 1100\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><rect width=\"1100\" height=\"1100\" fill=\"#1a1a2e\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"70\" font-size=\"36\" fill=\"#FFD700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"bold\">Closing Thought</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"115\" font-size=\"24\" fill=\"#888\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Horowitz on the Safety Net</text><rect x=\"80\" y=\"170\" width=\"940\" height=\"600\" fill=\"#1a1a2e\" stroke=\"#FFD700\" stroke-width=\"3\" rx=\"10\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"230\" font-size=\"26\" fill=\"#FFD700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"bold\">From the Insurance Chapter</text><text x=\"130\" y=\"290\" font-size=\"22\" fill=\"#ffffff\">'Insurance is the most boring part of</text><text x=\"130\" y=\"330\" font-size=\"22\" fill=\"#ffffff\">freelancing — and the most important.</text><text x=\"130\" y=\"390\" font-size=\"22\" fill=\"#ffffff\">The self-employed who succeed are not the</text><text x=\"130\" y=\"430\" font-size=\"22\" fill=\"#ffffff\">ones who never face crisis. They're the ones</text><text x=\"130\" y=\"470\" font-size=\"22\" fill=\"#ffffff\">who built protection systems before crisis</text><text x=\"130\" y=\"510\" font-size=\"22\" fill=\"#ffffff\">arrived.</text><text x=\"130\" y=\"570\" font-size=\"22\" fill=\"#ffffff\">Health, disability, liability, emergency reserves</text><text x=\"130\" y=\"610\" font-size=\"22\" fill=\"#ffffff\">— these are not luxuries. They are the</text><text x=\"130\" y=\"650\" font-size=\"22\" fill=\"#ffffff\">prerequisites of a sustainable career.</text><text x=\"130\" y=\"710\" font-size=\"22\" fill=\"#ffffff\">The day you stop being able to work, your</text><text x=\"130\" y=\"750\" font-size=\"22\" fill=\"#ffffff\">insurance becomes your client.'</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"780\" font-size=\"20\" fill=\"#FFD700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-style=\"italic\">— Sara Horowitz, The Freelancer's Bible</text><rect x=\"80\" y=\"800\" width=\"940\" height=\"250\" fill=\"#1a1a2e\" stroke=\"#FFD700\" stroke-width=\"2\" rx=\"10\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"845\" font-size=\"26\" fill=\"#0ea5e9\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"bold\">Next Lesson</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"895\" font-size=\"22\" fill=\"#ffffff\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Time, discipline, and boundaries —</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"935\" font-size=\"22\" fill=\"#ffffff\" text-anchor=\"middle\">the operational system that turns talent</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"985\" font-size=\"22\" fill=\"#ffffff\" text-anchor=\"middle\">into sustainable income without burnout.</text></svg>",
      "caption": "Safety net built. Now we build the sustainable working life that uses it."
     }
    }
