     "content": "EXERCISE (5 minutes): Write your 90-day commitment as a signed contract WITH YOURSELF. Include: 'On [date], I commit to executing the 90-day freelance business launch plan. By Day 30, I will have: LLC/sole prop with EIN, business bank account + Tax Reserve, insurance bound (GL + E&O + Disability + Health), retirement accounts opened. By Day 60, I will have: 3 case studies, pricing tiers written, 50 outreach messages sent, 8+ discovery calls scheduled. By Day 90, I will have: 3-5 contracts closed, first invoices sent, first SEP-IRA contribution made. Signed: ____ Date: ____.' Print it. Put it on the wall above your monitor.",
